            "authState": "Authenticated administrator (admin flag set)",
            "prerequisites": "An administrator GraphQL session (admin flag set) — login as the engagement admin account or an auth-token cookie belonging to an admin. The proof creates state (root albums and a scan) that was removed afterwards with userRemoveRootAlbum."
