            "findingId": "AUTH-09",
            "parameter": "password",
            "status": "exploited",
            "authState": "Administrator session for account creation; unauthenticated for the resulting logins",
            "prerequisites": "An administrator session is required to reach createUser/updateUser (there is no self-registration). The two disposable accounts used in the proof were created during this test."
